              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'><![CDATA[Day 7 retention was significantly higher for gate_30 (18.6% vs 18.2%, p < 0.05). Day 1 showed no significant difference (]]></run>
