              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>). Recommendation: keep the gate at </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>level 30 </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>as moving it to level 40 did not show a meaningful retention improvement.</run>
